  "notes": "His view of electoral participation changed: he refused to vote in 2016 ('the oppressor isn't going to allow you to vote your way out of your oppression') but voted for Biden and Harris and in his 2026 memoir called not voting irresponsible. This was not treated as evidence on democracy-best, which asks about forms of government. His 2016 shirt showing Malcolm X with Fidel Castro was also not used as evidence for any economic position. Most economic and foreign-policy statements have no recorded position."
